# <%= appTitle %>

> Generated by `lhx-cli create --template=fastify-micro` on <%= year %>.

A Fastify 5 + TypeScript microservice with Redis (BullMQ) built-in.

## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env
pnpm install
docker compose up redis -d
pnpm dev
```

## Endpoints

| Endpoint | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `GET /health/livez` | Liveness probe |
| `GET /health/readyz` | Readiness probe — db + redis |

## Scripts

| Script | What it does |
| --- | --- |
| `pnpm dev` | tsx watch (HTTP server) |
| `pnpm dev:worker` | tsx watch (BullMQ worker) |
| `pnpm build` | tsc → dist/ |
| `pnpm start` | node dist/server.js |
| `pnpm start:worker` | node dist/worker.js |

## Kubernetes

```bash
kubectl apply -f k8s/
```

